{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">日本東京購物地標之一，西武澀谷店結束營業。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">日本百貨業巨頭崇光西武旗下的西武澀谷店開業58年，周三是最後一天營業，有民眾到場打卡留念。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.JP.SEIBU-2300_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20268OL9aixEbq1790772699.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.JP.SEIBU-2300_001.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">據報該店近年持續虧損，前年接獲業主結束租約的通知。關閉的部分為「A館」、「B館」和「停車場館」，其餘部分則去除西武名稱後繼續營業。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.JP.SEIBU-2300_002.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026vm94zMpmH01790775363.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.JP.SEIBU-2300_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-30T14:20:22.982819+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}